  https://pillow.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/Image.html) can be used:

  ```python
  # Display edge maps for the first channel (at index 0)
  Image.fromarray(sobel_y[..., 0] / 4 + 0.5).show()
  Image.fromarray(sobel_x[..., 0] / 4 + 0.5).show()
  ```

